Complete local Rust example; the app itself does not execute it:
```rust
use std::sync::Mutex;

fn main() {
    let value = Mutex::new(3);
    {
        let mut guard = value.lock().expect("mutex poisoned");
        *guard += 4;
    }
    println!("{}", *value.lock().expect("mutex poisoned"));
}
```

